                <mxCell id="p1_lgt" value="Read three things off this diagram:&#xa;&#xa;1.  Every edge into the control plane is dashed. Cut them all and work continues on the last published artifacts — requirement R2.&#xa;2.  The kernel is two boxes and a local database. Everything clever happens out-of-band.&#xa;3.  Seam C sits between Agent and Tool Executor: the only point where an effect can be stopped before it lands." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A5464;" parent="1" vertex="1">
